<h3><u>waae abbasa</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><big>haay<br>thun mana abbas seeskat po<br>surs hussaini ghduneen rang<br>haay<br>shukhsi kaacho ni khabar laa<br>yood pi wakhla rgoieen noon shang<br>haay<br>mazloome karbala ghubing kasal biyons<br>haay<br><br>aay alamdaare hussain waae abbasa<br>waae abbasa abbasa<br><br>hsik chee zairs imami abbasi sahmar goey kha&nbsp;<br>neeshmaghi gopa abbasa<br>waae abbasa abbasa&nbsp;<br><br>mik fe se htoseelekh shooli aan na somaid dha<br>in yoogi wida abbasa&nbsp;<br>waae abbasa abbasa<br><br>deekh pero sakina la kusnarz baz goey kha&nbsp;<br>sruq na geeg ma abbasa<br>waae abbasa abbasa&nbsp;<br><br>koofa shaam pesh maghesh killa na chik chi fang se<br>skyore shakhsa abbasa<br>waae abbasa abbasa&nbsp;<br><br>kher ba geeg da khoon sa koqse shami rol la<br>ching se zainaba abbasa&nbsp;<br>waae abbasa abbasa</big></p>
